    "Export writes to a fixed, shared file EXPORT_DIR/chamados.csv that concurrent exports race on and that is left on disk after readfile — lib.php:125-150 (F4, beyond the BUG-004 leak it also names)",
    "Listing and CSV export expose every client's tickets to any logged-in client — index.php:44-47 and 72-73 (part of F2, beyond the planted ?ver IDOR)",
    "fputcsv quotes the header field with a space, so the first line was ID,Titulo,Status,Tecnico,\"Aberto em\" rather than the manifest literal — lib.php:130 (F7)",
    "PHP 8.4 deprecation of fputcsv without an explicit $escape; with display_errors on, it prints before header() and the download loses its headers — lib.php:130/138 (F8)",
    "Array-valued login[]/busca[] parameters raise an uncaught TypeError on the string-typed lib functions (HTTP 500) — index.php:22, 72 (F13)",
    "Session cookie without HttpOnly/SameSite and session.use_strict_mode off — index.php:15 (part of F6, beyond SEC-013)"
